#. Network cards read dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:29
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Initializing Network Card\n"
"Configuration</big></b><br>Please wait...<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ກຳລັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ\n"
"ກາດເຄືອຂ່າຍ</big></b><br>ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ...<br></p>\n"

#. Network cards read dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:34
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Aborting the Initialization:</big></b><br>\n"
"Safely abort the configuration utility by pressing<B>Abort</B> now.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຍົກເລີກການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:</big></b><br>\n"
"ຍົກເລີກເຄື່ອງມືການຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງປອດໄພໂດຍການກົດ<B>Abort</B> ດຽວນີ້.</p>\n"

#. Network cards write dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:40
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Saving Network Card\n"
"Configuration</big></b><br>Please wait...<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ກຳລັງບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ\n"
"ກາດເຄືອຂ່າຍ</big></b><br>ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ...<br></p>\n"

#. Network cards write dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:45
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Aborting Saving:</big></b><br>\n"
"Abort saving by pressing <b>Abort</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຍົກເລີກການບັນທຶກ:</big></b><br>\n"
"ຍົກເລີກການບັນທຶກໂດຍການກົດ <b>Abort</b>.</p>\n"

#. Network setup method help
#. NetworkManager and wicked are programs
#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:51
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Network Setup Method</big></b></p>\n"
"<p>Use the <b>NetworkManager</b> as a desktop applet\n"
"managing connections for all interfaces. It is well suited\n"
"for switching among wired and wireless networks.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ</big></b></p>\n"
"<p>ໃຊ້ <b>NetworkManager</b> ເປັນແອັບເພລັດເທິງເດັສທັອບ\n"
"ເພື່ອຈັດການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບທຸກອິນເຕີເຟສ. ມັນເໝາະສຳລັບ\n"
"ການສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງເຄືອຂ່າຍແບບມີສາຍ ແລະ ໄຮ້ສາຍ.</p>\n"

#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:57
msgid ""
"<p>Use <b>wicked</b> if you do not run a desktop environment\n"
"or need to use multiple interfaces at the same time.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໃຊ້ <b>wicked</b> ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເດັສທັອບ\n"
"ຫຼື ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຫຼາຍອິນເຕີເຟສພ້ອມກັນ.</p>\n"

#. For systems not including NetworkManager by default (bnc#892678)
#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:63
msgid ""
"<p><b>NetworkManager</b> is not part of every base\n"
"installation repository. For example, to enable it on SUSE\n"
"Linux Enterprise Server add the Workstation Extension\n"
"repository and install the 'NetworkManager' package.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>NetworkManager</b> ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງທຸກໆ\n"
"ຄັງເກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງພື້ນຖານ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໃນ SUSE\n"
"Linux Enterprise Server ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບ Workstation Extension\n"
"ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ 'NetworkManager'.</p>\n"

#. IPv6 help
#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:71
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>IPv6 Protocol Settings</big></b></p>\n"
"<p>Check <b>Enable IPv6</b> to enable the ipv6 module in the kernel.\n"
"It is possible to use IPv6 together with IPv4. This is the default option.\n"
"To disable IPv6, uncheck this option. This will blacklist the kernel \n"
"module for ipv6. If the IPv6 protocol is not used on your network, the "
"response \n"
"time can be faster.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອະນຸສັນຍາ IPv6</big></b></p>\n"
"<p>ໝາຍເລືອກ <b>ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ IPv6</b> ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ ipv6 ໃນເຄີນໍ.\n"
"ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ IPv6 ຮ່ວມກັບ IPv4. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານ IPv6, ໃຫ້ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍຕົວເລືອກນີ້. ນີ້ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ໂມດູນເຄີນໍ \n"
"ສຳລັບ ipv6 ເປັນບັນຊີດຳ. ຖ້າອະນຸສັນຍາ IPv6 ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ເວລາຕອບສະໜອງ \n"
"ຈະສາມາດໄວຂຶ້ນໄດ້.</p>\n"

#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:83
msgid "<p>All changes will be applied after reboot.</p>"
msgstr "<p>ການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດຈະມີຜົນຫຼັງຈາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບໃໝ່ (reboot).</p>"

#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:85
msgid ""
"<p>Enter the name servers and domain search list for resolving \n"
"hostnames. Usually they can be obtained by DHCP.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ປ້ອນເນມເຊີເວີ (name servers) ແລະ ລາຍການຄົ້ນຫາໂດເມນສຳລັບການແປ\n"
"ຊື່ໂຮສ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວສາມາດຮັບຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຜ່ານ DHCP.</p>\n"

#. resolver dialog help
#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:90
msgid ""
"<p>A name server is a computer that translates hostnames into\n"
"IP addresses. This value must be entered as an <b>IP address</b>\n"
"(for example, 192.168.0.42), not as a hostname.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເນມເຊີເວີ ແມ່ນຄອມພິວເຕີທີ່ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ແປຊື່ໂຮສໃຫ້ເປັນ\n"
"ທີ່ຢູ່ IP. ຄ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງປ້ອນເປັນ <b>ທີ່ຢູ່ IP</b>\n"
"(ຕົວຢ່າງ, 192.168.0.42), ບໍ່ແມ່ນຊື່ໂຮສ.</p>\n"

#. resolver dialog help
#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:98
msgid ""
"<p>Search domain is the domain name where hostname searching starts.\n"
"The primary search domain is usually the same as the domain name of\n"
"your computer (for example, suse.de). There may be additional search "
"domains\n"
"(such as suse.com). Separate the domains with commas or white space.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Search domain ແມ່ນຊື່ໂດເມນທີ່ການຄົ້ນຫາຊື່ໂຮສຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"Search domain ຫຼັກ ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະຄືກັນກັບຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງ\n"
"ຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງເຈົ້າ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, suse.de). ອາດຈະມີ search domain ເພີ່ມເຕີມ\n"
"(ເຊັ່ນ suse.com). ໃຫ້ແຍກແຕ່ລະໂດເມນດ້ວຍຈຸດ ຫຼື ຍະຫວ່າງ.</p>\n"

#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:109
msgid ""
"<p>Enter local name for this computer (e.g. <i>mymachine</i>). The name "
"will\n"
"be stored in <i>/etc/hostname</i>. You can also choose whether the hostname "
"can\n"
"be obtained from DHCP. In such case you can pick particular dhcp interface "
"which\n"
"will be used for obtaining the hostname or leave it up to the network "
"service.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ປ້ອນຊື່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບຄອມພິວເຕີເຄື່ອງນີ້ (ເຊັ່ນ <i>mymachine</i>). ຊື່ນີ້ຈະ\n"
"ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ <i>/etc/hostname</i>. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າຈະໃຫ້ຊື່ໂຮສ\n"
"ຮັບມາຈາກ DHCP ຫຼື ບໍ່. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກອິນເຕີເຟສ dhcp ທີ່ເຈາະຈົງ\n"
"ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮັບຊື່ໂຮສ ຫຼື ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ເປັນໜ້າທີ່ຂອງບໍລິການເຄືອຂ່າຍ.</p>\n"

#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:120
msgid ""
"<p>Select the way how the DNS configuration will be modified (name servers,\n"
"search list, the content of <i>/etc/resolv.conf</i>). Normally, it is "
"handled\n"
"by the <i>netconfig</i> script, which merges statically defined data with\n"
"dynamically obtained data (e.g. from the DHCP client, NetworkManager,\n"
"etc.). This is the default. <b>Use Default Policy</b> is sufficient for "
"most\n"
"configurations.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລືອກວິທີການທີ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS ຈະຖືກປັບປ່ຽນ (ເນມເຊີເວີ,\n"
"ລາຍການຄົ້ນຫາ, ເນື້ອໃນຂອງ <i>/etc/resolv.conf</i>). ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ມັນຈະຖືກຈັດການ\n"
"ໂດຍສະຄຣິບ <i>netconfig</i>, ເຊິ່ງຈະລວມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳນົດແບບຄົງທີ່ເຂົ້າກັບ\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບມາແບບໄດນາມິກ (ເຊັ່ນ ຈາກ DHCP client, NetworkManager,\n"
"ແລະ ອື່ນໆ). ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ. <b>Use Default Policy</b> ແມ່ນພຽງພໍແລ້ວສຳລັບ\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.</p>\n"

#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:133
msgid ""
"<p>By choosing <b>Only Manually</b>, <i>netconfig</i> will no longer be\n"
"allowed to modify <i>/etc/resolv.conf</i>. You can however edit the file\n"
"manually. By choosing <b>Use Custom Policy</b>, you may specify a custom\n"
"policy string, which consists of a comma-separated list of interface names,\n"
"including wildcards, with STATIC and STATIC_FALLBACK as predefined special\n"
"values. For more information, see the <i>netconfig</i> manual page. Note:\n"
"Leaving the field blank is the same as using the <b> Only Manually</b>\n"
"policy.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໂດຍການເລືອກ <b>ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ</b>, <i>netconfig</i> ຈະບໍ່ຖືກອະນຸຍາດ\n"
"ໃຫ້ດັດແກ້ <i>/etc/resolv.conf</i> ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ ທ່ານສາມາດດັດແກ້ໄຟລ໌\n"
"ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້. ໂດຍການເລືອກ <b>ໃຊ້ນະໂຍບາຍແບບກຳນົດເອງ</b>, ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸ\n"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມນະໂຍບາຍ, ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ຂອງຊື່ອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ,\n"
"ລວມທັງ wildcards, ໂດຍມີ STATIC ແລະ STATIC_FALLBACK ເປັນຄ່າພິເສດ\n"
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໜ້າຄູ່ມືຂອງ <i>netconfig</i>. ໝາຍເຫດ:\n"
"ການປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຫ້ອງວ່າງໄວ້ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບການໃຊ້ <b> ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ</b>\n"
"ນະໂຍບາຍ.</p>\n"

#. DHCP dialog help 1/7
#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:151
msgid "<p><b><big>DHCP Client Options</big></b></p>"
msgstr "<p><b><big>ຕົວເລືອກ DHCP Client</big></b></p>"

#. DHCP dialog help 2/7
#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:153
msgid ""
"<p>The <b>DHCP Client Identifier</b>, if left empty, defaults to\n"
"the hardware address of the network interface. It must be different for "
"each\n"
"DHCP client on a single network. Therefore, specify a unique free-form\n"
"identifier here if you have several (virtual) machines using the same\n"
"network interface and thus the same hardware address.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຕົວລະບຸລູກຂ່າຍ DHCP</b>, ຖ້າປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕາມ\n"
"ທີ່ຢູ່ຮາດແວຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ມັນຈະຕ້ອງແຕກຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ\n"
"ລູກຂ່າຍ DHCP ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍດຽວກັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸຕົວລະບຸແບບອິດສະຫຼະ\n"
"ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ ຫາກທ່ານມີເຄື່ອງ (ສະເມືອນ) ຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງທີ່ໃຊ້\n"
"ອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍອັນດຽວກັນ ແລະ ມີທີ່ຢູ່ຮາດແວອັນດຽວກັນ.</p>"

#. DHCP dialog help 3/7
#: src/include/network/lan/help.rb:165
msgid ""
"<p>The <b>Hostname to Send</b> specifies a string used for the\n"
"hostname option field when the DHCP client sends messages to the DHCP "
"server. Some \n"
"DHCP servers update name server zones (forward and reverse records) \n"
"according to this hostname (dynamic DNS).</p>\n"
"Some DHCP servers require the <b>Hostname to Send</b> option field to\n"
"contain a specific string in the DHCP messages from clients. Leave <b>AUTO</"
"b>\n"
"to send the current hostname (for example, the one defined in <tt>/etc/"
"HOSTNAME</tt>). \n"
"If you do not want to send a hostname, leave the field empty.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Hostname to Send</b> ລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນຊ່ອງຕົວເລືອກຊື່ໂຮສ\n"
"ເມື່ອ DHCP client ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມໄປຫາ DHCP server. DHCP server ບາງຕົວ\n"
"ຈະອັບເດດ name server zones (forward ແລະ reverse records)\n"
"ຕາມຊື່ໂຮສນີ້ (dynamic DNS).</p>\n"
"DHCP server ບາງຕົວຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຊ່ອງຕົວເລືອກ <b>Hostname to Send</b>\n"
"ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ DHCP ຈາກ client. ໃຫ້ປະເປັນ <b>AUTO</b>\n"
"ເພື່ອສົ່ງຊື່ໂຮສປັດຈຸບັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ ຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ <tt>/etc/HOSTNAME</tt>).\n"
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການສົ່ງຊື່ໂຮສ ໃຫ້ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້.</p>\n"

#: src/include/network/lan/wizards.rb:100
msgid "Initializing..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ..."

#. Popup text
#: src/include/network/routines.rb:124
msgid "These packages need to be installed:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ:"

#. Popup text
#: src/include/network/routines.rb:142
msgid ""
"The required packages are not installed.\n"
"The configuration will be aborted.\n"
"\n"
"Try again?\n"
msgstr ""
"ແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ.\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ.\n"
"\n"
"ລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງບໍ່?\n"

#. Disables all widgets which cannot be configured with current network service
#.
#. see bnc#433084
#. if listed any items, disable them, if show_popup, show warning popup
#.
#. returns true if items were disabled
#. Workaround for usage in old CWM which also cache content of cwm items
#: src/include/network/routines.rb:670
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/interfaces_table.rb:78
msgid ""
"Network is currently handled by NetworkManager\n"
"or completely disabled. YaST is unable to configure some options."
msgstr ""
"ເຄືອຂ່າຍກຳລັງຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ NetworkManager\n"
"ຫຼື ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານທັງໝົດ. YaST ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງຕົວເລືອກໄດ້."

#. Confirmation: label text (detecting hardware: xxx)
#: src/include/network/routines.rb:731
msgid "Network Cards"
msgstr "ກາດເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. Confirmation: label text (detecting hardware: xxx)
#: src/include/network/routines.rb:735
msgid "Modems"
