msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂັ້ນສູງ"

#. Wireless expert dialog help 1/5
#: src/lib/y2network/dialogs/wireless_expert_settings.rb:75
msgid ""
"<p>Here, set additional configuration parameters\n"
"(rarely needed).</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພາລາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມ\n"
"(ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້).</p>"

#. Wireless expert dialog help 2/5
#: src/lib/y2network/dialogs/wireless_expert_settings.rb:79
msgid ""
"<p>To use your wireless LAN card in master or ad-hoc mode,\n"
"set the <b>Channel</b> the card should use here. This is not needed\n"
"for managed mode--the card will hop through the channels searching for "
"access\n"
"points in that case.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກາດ LAN ໄຮ້ສາຍໃນໂໝດ master ຫຼື ad-hoc,\n"
"ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ <b>Channel</b> ທີ່ກາດຄວນໃຊ້ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້. ນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ\n"
"ສຳລັບໂໝດ managed--ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ ກາດຈະຄົ້ນຫາຊ່ອງສັນຍານເພື່ອຫາ access\n"
"points ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.</p>\n"

#. Wireless expert dialog help 3/5
#: src/lib/y2network/dialogs/wireless_expert_settings.rb:86
msgid ""
"<p>In some rare cases, you may want to set a transmission\n"
"<b>Bit Rate</b> explicitly. The default is to go as fast as possible.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການກຳນົດ <b>Bit Rate</b>\n"
"ການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນໃຫ້ໄວທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເຮັດໄດ້.</p>"

#. Wireless expert dialog help 4/5
#: src/lib/y2network/dialogs/wireless_expert_settings.rb:91
msgid ""
"<p>In an environment with multiple <b>Access Points</b>, you may want to\n"
" define the one to which to connect by entering its MAC address.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີ <b>Access Points</b> ຫຼາຍອັນ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການ\n"
" ລະບຸອັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍການປ້ອນ MAC address ຂອງມັນ.</p>"

#. Wireless expert dialog help 5/5
#: src/lib/y2network/dialogs/wireless_expert_settings.rb:96
msgid ""
"<p><b>Use Power Management</b> enables power saving mechanisms.\n"
"This is generally a good idea, especially if you are a laptop user and may\n"
"be disconnected from AC power.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Use Power Management</b> ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ກົນໄກການປະຢັດພະລັງງານ.\n"
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ດີ, ໂດຍສະເພາະຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ແລັບທັອບ ແລະ ອາດຈະ\n"
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ສຽບສາຍສາກ.</p>\n"

