#: src/lib/y2network/dialogs/wireless_wep_keys.rb:270
msgid ""
"The WEP key is not valid. WEP key can be specified either directly in hex "
"digits, with or without dashes, or in the key's ASCII representation (prefix "
"s: ), or as a passphrase which will be hashed (prefix h: )."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດ WEP ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ລະຫັດ WEP ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ທັງໃນຮູບແບບເລກຖານສິບຫົກ (hex), ຈະມີ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີຂີດຕໍ່ກໍໄ"
"ດ້, ຫຼື ໃນຮູບແບບ ASCII (ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ s: ), ຫຼື ເປັນ passphrase ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກ hashed (ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ "
"h: )."

