msgid ""
"<p>Enter an <b>IPv4 Address Label</b>, an <b>IP Address</b>, and\n"
"the <b>Netmask</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ປ້ອນ <b>IPv4 Address Label</b>, <b>ທີ່ຢູ່ IP</b>, ແລະ\n"
"<b>Netmask</b>.</p>"

#. Aliases dialog help 3/4
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/additional_addresses.rb:91
msgid ""
"<p><b>IPv4 Address Label</b>, formerly known as Alias Name, is optional and "
"legacy. The total\n"
"length of interface name (inclusive of the colon and label) is\n"
"limited to 15 characters. The obsolete ifconfig utility truncates it after 9 "
"characters.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>IPv4 Address Label</b> ຫຼື ທີ່ເຄີຍຮູ້ຈັກກັນໃນຊື່ Alias Name ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກເສີມ ແລະ ເປັນແບ"
"ບເກົ່າ. ຄວາມຍາວ\n"
"ທັງໝົດຂອງຊື່ອິນເຕີເຟສ (ລວມທັງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈ້ຳສອງເມັດ ແລະ ປ້າຍຊື່) ແມ່ນ\n"
"ຈຳກັດຢູ່ທີ່ 15 ຕົວອັກສອນ. ເຄື່ອງມື ifconfig ທີ່ຫຼ້າສະໄໝຈະຕັດມັນອອກຫຼັງຈາກ 9 ຕົວອັກສອນ.</p>"

#. Aliases dialog help 3/4, #83766
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/additional_addresses.rb:99
msgid ""
"<p>Do not include the interface name in the label. For example, enter "
"<b>foo</b> instead of <b>eth0:foo</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ບໍ່ຕ້ອງລວມຊື່ອິນເຕີເຟສໄວ້ໃນປ້າຍຊື່. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ <b>foo</b> ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ <b>eth0:foo</b>"
".</p>"

