#. bond with more than one interface sharing the same physical port id
#.
#. @return true if valid or user decision if not
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/bond_port.rb:136
msgid ""
"At least one selected device is already configured.\n"
"Adapt the configuration for bonding?\n"
msgstr ""
"ມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອຸປະກອນທີ່ເລືອກຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ແລ້ວ.\n"
"ຕ້ອງການປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບການເຮັດ bonding ບໍ່?\n"

#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/bond_port.rb:143
msgid ""
"At least one selected device is using a MAC address for renaming the "
"device.\n"
"Would you like to change the renaming mechanism to BusID?\n"
msgstr ""
"ມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອຸປະກອນທີ່ເລືອກກຳລັງໃຊ້ MAC address ໃນການປ່ຽນຊື່ອຸປະກອນ.\n"
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນກົນໄກການປ່ຽນຊື່ເປັນ BusID ບໍ່?\n"

#. Translators: Warn the user about not desired effect
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/bond_port.rb:246
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The interfaces selected share the same physical port and bonding them \n"
"may not have the desired effect of redundancy.\n"
"\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"Really continue?\n"
msgstr ""
"ອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ເລືອກໃຊ້ພອດທາງກາຍະພາບດຽວກັນ ແລະ ການເຮັດ bonding ພວກມັນ \n"
"ອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃນເລື່ອງຄວາມຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ (redundancy).\n"
"\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"ຕ້ອງການສືບຕໍ່ແທ້ບໍ່?\n"

