#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/boot_protocol.rb:241
msgid ""
"No hostname has been specified. We recommend to associate \n"
"a hostname with a static IP, otherwise the machine name will \n"
"not be resolvable without an active network connection.\n"
"\n"
"Really leave the hostname blank?\n"
msgstr ""
"ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຊື່ໂຮສ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ຈັບຄູ່ \n"
"ຊື່ໂຮສເຂົ້າກັບ IP ຄົງທີ່, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຊື່ເຄື່ອງຈະ \n"
"ບໍ່ສາມາດແປຊື່ໄດ້ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່.\n"
"\n"
"ຕ້ອງການປະຊື່ໂຮສໃຫ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້ແທ້ບໍ່?\n"

#. Popup text
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/boot_protocol.rb:259
msgid ""
"Duplicate IP address detected.\n"
"Really continue?\n"
msgstr ""
"ກວດພົບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຊ້ຳກັນ.\n"
"ຕ້ອງການສືບຕໍ່ແທ້ບໍ່?\n"

#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/boot_protocol.rb:269
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Address Setup</big></b></p>\n"
"<p>Select <b>No Address Setup</b> if you do not want to assign an IP address "
"to this device.\n"
"This is particularly useful for bonding ethernet devices.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່</big></b></p>\n"
"<p>ເລືອກ <b>ບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່</b> ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ IP ໃຫ້ກັບອຸປະກອນນີ້.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເປັນພິເສດສຳລັບການລວມອຸປະກອນອີເທີເນັດ.</p>\n"

#. Address dialog help 2/8
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/boot_protocol.rb:276
msgid ""
"<p>Select <b>Dynamic Address</b> if you do not have a static IP address \n"
"assigned by the system administrator or your Internet provider.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລືອກ <b>Dynamic Address</b> ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ມີທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຄົງທີ່ \n"
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ ຫຼື ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການອິນເຕີເນັດຂອງເຈົ້າ.</p>\n"

#. Address dialog help 3/8
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/boot_protocol.rb:281
msgid ""
"<p>Choose one of the dynamic address assignment methods. Select <b>DHCP</b>\n"
"if you have a DHCP server running on your local network. Network addresses \n"
"are then automatically obtained from the server.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນວິທີການກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ແບບໄດນາມິກ. ເລືອກ <b>DHCP</b>\n"
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີ DHCP server ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງເຈົ້າ. ທີ່ຢູ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ \n"
"ຈະຖືກຮັບມາຈາກເຊີເວີໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.</p>\n"

#. Address dialog help 4/8
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/boot_protocol.rb:287
msgid ""
"<p>To search for an IP address and assign it statically, select \n"
"<b>Zeroconf</b>. To use DHCP and fall back to zeroconf, select <b>DHCP + "
"Zeroconf\n"
"</b>. Otherwise, the network addresses must be assigned <b>Statically</b>.</"
"p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາທີ່ຢູ່ IP ແລະ ກຳນົດມັນແບບຄົງທີ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ \n"
"<b>Zeroconf</b>. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ DHCP ແລະ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ zeroconf ສຳຮອງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <b>DHCP + "
"Zeroconf\n"
"</b>. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທີ່ຢູ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດແບບ <b>Statically</b> (ຄົງທີ່).</p>\n"

#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/boot_protocol.rb:295
msgid ""
"<p>DHCP configuration is not recommended for this product.\n"
"Components of this product might not work with DHCP.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DHCP ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນນີ້.\n"
