#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/client_cert_path.rb:32
msgid "&Client Certificate"
msgstr "ໃບຮັບຮອງຂອງ &Client"

#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/client_cert_path.rb:36
msgid ""
"<p>TLS uses a <b>Client Certificate</b> instead of a username and\n"
"password combination for authentication. It uses a public and private key "
"pair\n"
"to encrypt negotiation communication, therefore you will additionally need\n"
"a <b>Client Key</b> file that contains your private key and\n"
"the appropriate <b>Client Key Password</b> for that file.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>TLS ໃຊ້ <b>ໃບຮັບຮອງຂອງ Client</b> ແທນການໃຊ້ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ\n"
"ລະຫັດຜ່ານຮ່ວມກັນເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. ມັນໃຊ້ຄູ່ລະຫັດສາທາລະນະ ແລະ ສ່ວນຕົວ\n"
"ເພື່ອເຂົ້າລະຫັດການສື່ສານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ\n"
"ໄຟລ໌ <b>Client Key</b> ທີ່ເກັບລະຫັດສ່ວນຕົວຂອງເຈົ້າ ແລະ\n"
"<b>Client Key Password</b> ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ.</p>\n"

