#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/ip4_forwarding.rb:42
msgid "Enable &IPv4 Forwarding"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການສົ່ງຕໍ່ &IPv4"

#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/ip4_forwarding.rb:46
msgid ""
"<p>Enable <b>IPv4 Forwarding</b> (forwarding packets from external networks\n"
"to the internal one) if this system is a router.\n"
"<b>Important:</b> if the firewall is enabled, allowing forwarding alone is "
"not enough. \n"
"You should enable masquerading and/or set at least one redirect rule in the\n"
"firewall configuration. Use the YaST firewall module.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເປີດໃຊ້ <b>IPv4 Forwarding</b> (ການສົ່ງຕໍ່ແພັກເກັດຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກ\n"
"ໄປຫາພາຍໃນ) ຖ້າລະບົບນີ້ເປັນເຣົາເຕີ.\n"
"<b>ສຳຄັນ:</b> ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ໄຟວໍ, ການອະນຸຍາດການສົ່ງຕໍ່ພຽງຢ່າງດຽວແມ່ນບໍ່ພໍ. \n"
"ເຈົ້າຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ masquerading ແລະ/ຫຼື ກຳນົດກົດການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ (redirect rule) ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງກົດໃ"
"ນ\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂມດູນ YaST firewall.</p>\n"

