#.
#. @param names    [Array<String>] Drivers names
#. @param selected [String,nil] Initially selected driver (nil if no driver is selected)
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/kernel_module.rb:40
msgid "&Module Name"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂມດູນ (&M)"

#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/kernel_module.rb:44
msgid ""
"<p><b>Kernel Module</b>. Enter the kernel module (driver) name \n"
"for your network device here. If the device is already configured, see if "
"there is more than one driver available for\n"
"your device in the drop-down list. If necessary, choose a driver from the "
"list, but usually the default value works.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Kernel Module</b>. ປ້ອນຊື່ໂມດູນເຄີເນິນ (ໄດຣເວີ) \n"
"ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້. ຖ້າອຸປະກອນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງວ່າມີໄດຣເວີ\n"
"ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງອັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນຂອງເຈົ້າໃນລາຍການແບບດຶງລົງ. ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດຣເວີຈາກລາຍກາ"
"ນ, ແຕ່ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຄ່າມາດຕະຖານກໍສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້.</p>\n"

#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/kernel_module.rb:58
msgid "Auto"
msgstr "ອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. Constructor
#.
#. @param options [String] Driver options
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/kernel_options.rb:42
msgid ""
"<p>Additionally, specify <b>Options</b> for the kernel module. Use this\n"
"format: <i>option</i>=<i>value</i>. Each entry should be space-separated, "
"for example: <i>io=0x300 irq=5</i>. <b>Note:</b> If two cards are \n"
"configured with the same module name, the options will be merged while "
"saving.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸ <b>Options</b> ສຳລັບໂມດູນເຄີເນິນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້\n"
"ຮູບແບບນີ້: <i>option</i>=<i>value</i>. ແຕ່ລະລາຍການຄວນແຍກດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: <i>"
"io=0x300 irq=5</i>. <b>ໝາຍເຫດ:</b> ຖ້າມີສອງກາດທີ່ \n"
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍຊື່ໂມດູນດຽວກັນ, ຕົວເລືອກຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນໃນຂະນະບັນທຶກ.</p>\n"

