#. TRANSLATORS: help text for Device Activation
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/startmode.rb:62
msgid ""
"<p><b>Manually</b>: You control the interface manually\n"
"via 'ifup' or 'qinternet' (see 'User Controlled' below).</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ</b>: ເຈົ້າຄວບຄຸມອິນເຕີເຟສດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ\n"
"ຜ່ານ 'ifup' ຫຼື 'qinternet' (ເບິ່ງ 'User Controlled' ລຸ່ມນີ້).</p>\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: help text for Device Activation
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/startmode.rb:67
msgid ""
"<b>On Cable Connection</b>:\n"
"The interface is watched for whether there is a physical\n"
"network connection. That means either the cable is connected or the\n"
"wireless interface can connect to an access point.\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>On Cable Connection</b>:\n"
"ອິນເຕີເຟສຈະຖືກກວດສອບວ່າມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍທາງກາຍະພາບ\n"
"ຫຼື ບໍ່. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ສາຍເຄເບິນຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ອິນເຕີເຟສ\n"
"ໄຮ້ສາຍສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ access point ໄດ້.\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: help text for Device Activation
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/startmode.rb:74
msgid ""
"With <b>On Hotplug</b>,\n"
"the interface is set up as soon as it is available. This is\n"
"nearly the same as 'At Boot Time', but does not result in an error at\n"
"boot time if the interface is not present.\n"
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍ <b>On Hotplug</b>,\n"
"ອິນເຕີເຟສຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າທັນທີທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນ\n"
"ເກືອບຄືກັນກັບ 'At Boot Time', ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນຂະນະ\n"
"boot ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບອິນເຕີເຟສ.\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: help text for Device Activation
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/startmode.rb:81
msgid ""
"Using <b>On NFSroot</b> is similar to <tt>auto</tt>. Interfaces with this "
"startmode will never\n"
"be shut down via <tt>rcnetwork stop</tt>. <tt>ifdown <iface></tt> is still "
"available.\n"
"Use this if you have an NFS or iSCSI root filesystem.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ <b>On NFSroot</b> ແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັບ <tt>auto</tt>. ອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ມີໂໝດການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກ\n"
"ປິດຜ່ານ <tt>rcnetwork stop</tt>. ແຕ່ <tt>ifdown <iface></tt> ຍັງຄົງສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດນີ້ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລະບົບໄຟລ໌ root ແບບ NFS ຫຼື iSCSI.\n"

#. Device activation main help. The individual parts will be
#. substituted as %1
#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/startmode.rb:93
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Device Activation</big></b></p> \n"
"<p>Choose when to bring up the network interface. <b>At Boot Time</b> "
"activates it during system boot, \n"
"<b>Never</b> does not start the device.\n"
"%1</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການເປີດໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນ</big></b></p> \n"
"<p>ເລືອກເວລາທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍ. <b>At Boot Time</b> ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ມັນໃນລະຫວ່າງການ "
"boot ລະບົບ, \n"
"<b>Never</b> ຈະບໍ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອຸປະກອນເລີຍ.\n"
"%1</p>\n"

