#: src/lib/y2network/widgets/udev_rules.rb:71
msgid ""
"<p><b>Udev Rules</b> are rules for the kernel device manager that allow\n"
"associating the MAC address or BusID of the network device with its name "
"(for\n"
"example, eth1, wlan0 ) and assures a persistent device name upon reboot.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Udev Rules</b> ແມ່ນກົດສຳລັບຕົວຈັດການອຸປະກອນຂອງເຄີເນິນທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້\n"
"ຈັບຄູ່ MAC address ຫຼື BusID ຂອງອຸປະກອນເຄືອຂ່າຍກັບຊື່ຂອງມັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ\n"
"eth1, wlan0 ) ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຊື່ອຸປະກອນຈະຄົງທີ່ຫຼັງຈາກ reboot.\n"

